{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"format\": \"是\",\n  \"preview\": \"否\",\n  \"fits\": \"是\",\n  \"typical\": \"是\",\n  \"why\": \"句式上，以“对亲近的渴望与对亲近的珍惜”为主语，用“始终伴着”建立两者与不确定性的关系，是最小完整关系句，而非两个名词的并列。它没有人称和具体动作，也没有预告发展路线或结局，更没有把这层关系预设为冲突。各段都能落在这一关系范围内：从最初渴望亲近却无法确认回应，到享受亲近、舍不得幸福流逝，再到独自回味、重新沉醉，以及最后承认这段幸福真实发生过却没有得到保证；即使有些段落暂时沉浸于快乐，也不脱离这一关系。它抓住了整条线的核心：亲近既是值得渴望和珍惜的真实幸福，又因对方的回应无法确定、幸福的延续无法保证而难以安顿。\",\n  \"fix\": \"\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6e06a9d4-7c57-498e-b63a-3ad18a51a669", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T012415304378Z", "elapsed_seconds": 38.718, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T01:24:54.022994+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5a567ecd5ee107704133b0b5bb2ca1633b7c046b2c382ce122a1edbb77ce5743", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f63